description	"Tusken Raider 

A 2-life class with a unique blend of Melee weapons, slug-based guns, and Wookiee characteristics.   

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Gaffi Stick (Staff/Yellow Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- No Saber Training
-- 15% faster Movement
-- 200% Spec Dmg mult
-- 14% more AS
-- 20% more Kb

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Fury (3)
- 140% Slower Cooldowns
-- 99% slower Resource Decay
- Getup (2)
- Strength (1)
- Healing (1)"